/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (You will be happy to know that our products are low in VOCs and are sustainably sourced. We buy flooring certified to be green and harmless to the environment, so you can rest easy that you consciously have decided to help the planet.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
124 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
