/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Laminate floors react to high moisture content. Thus make sure to clean up any standing water on the floor as soon as possible. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
130 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Maintaining a proper temperature is also essential in caring for your wooden floors. Adherence to the following parameters will ensure that your floors look as good as new, even years down the line.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
