136 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (All of our laminate floors are resistant to staining \(to household products such as acetone, colas, nail lacquer, fruit drinks, or similar products\). However, strong chemicals can damage your floor. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
137 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (One of the many advantages of laminate floors is that they are super easy to clean and take care of. However, if you happen to get some tough stains on the floor, please feel free to reach out to us for guidance. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
