<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Use carpets and rugs made from 'breathable' materials \(such as woven fabric\), avoiding carpets and rugs with solid rubber or vinyl backings that could trap moisture under the material.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
156 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText ( You should also ensure that the underside of the carpets and rugs is kept clean and free from abrasives that could damage your floors.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
